      en: ["Length: ~100 km.", "Watershed: 1,500 km².", "Home to Indochinese tiger populations.", "Mangrove forests at estuary cover 20 km².", "Annual rainfall exceeds 4,000 mm.", "Over 300 bird species recorded."],
